  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 274942494}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e166f6d3ce8d8e747aab55d2168b0430, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  dropdown: {fileID: 274942496}
  tooltips:
  - Average Displacement Error - Euclidean Distance Error of observations compared
    against the predicted trajectory, and averaged over the standard manouvre duration.
  - Final Displacement Error - Euclidean Distance Error of the Final observation,
    and the matching point on the predicted trajectory.
  - Lowest Common SubSequence - Finds whether each point of the observed and predicted
    trajectory matches an acceptable distance value. Generates a ratio of error for
    the trajectory comparison operation, e.g. 0.01 (1% of points did not match).
  - Lowest Common SubSequence on the final point only - Finds whether the most recent
    point is a match, and generates an error value of either 1 or 0.
