  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TooltipTrigger
  tooltipMessage: 'Enter the value which controls how much the error measure is reduced
    by on every sample. This allows the CUSUM value to be reduced over time, increasing
    the resiliance to noise, but increasing time to detection. The value should ideally
    be equal to roughly the amount of error the system experiences under Standard
    Behaviour. '
